        <h2><strong>Getting Started the Right Way</strong></h2>
        <p>None of this requires overhauling your salon overnight. Most owners start by switching just the booking and reminder workflow, since that alone addresses the biggest source of lost revenue. Deposits for premium slots and a simple loyalty structure typically follow within the first month once staff are comfortable with the new flow.</p>
