        <h2><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2>
        <p><strong>1. How much can automated reminders actually reduce no-shows?</strong> Most salons see a meaningful drop within the first month simply from sending SMS or WhatsApp reminders with a confirmation request, since the biggest cause of no-shows is forgetfulness rather than intent.</p>
        <p><strong>2. Will asking for a deposit put off clients?</strong> Not when it is built into the online booking flow itself. Clients see the policy upfront before confirming, which feels far less awkward than a phone call asking for payment after the fact.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Can the system notify clients on a waiting list automatically?</strong> Yes. When a slot opens up from a cancellation, the next client on the waiting list gets notified right away, so the gap gets filled instead of sitting empty.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Does client history work across multiple salon branches?</strong> Yes. Client profiles, preferences, and loyalty points are shared across branches, so a client gets the same personalized experience no matter which location they visit.</p>
        <p><strong>5. Is this suitable for a small, single location salon?</strong> Absolutely. Booking reminders and basic loyalty tracking help small salons just as much as large chains, often with an even bigger relative impact since every missed appointment matters more.</p>
